'''Fulfilling Our Dreams''' (Korean: '''꿈을 이룰거야''' ''Kkumeul Irulgeoya'') is the opening theme for the 2017 Korean redubbing of ''[[M04|Celebi: Voice of the Forest]]''. It is performed by Kwon Ayeong.

The song was uploaded to the composer's YouTube channel on January 23, 2022.

